   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable, author is Opus), head 35e94c7: VERDICT APPROVE, no finding.**\n\n- **R96c and R96d.** Both captures are the `.hop` page \"Ce message ne vous est pas destiné\": no `delflag`, no `nonlu`, no `flagn0.gif`. Both oracles have no exception and give `isFavoritesOrRead: \"\"` and `isRedFlagged: false`. So `noLink` is the only list that fits: `unreadLinkOnly` and `overlap` would both fail on them.\n- **Tests.** `swift test --filter 'TopicPageFlagOracleTests|TopicPageMetadataOracleTests|MessageBlockOracleTests'` runs 10 tests and all pass. That includes the exhaustive-list test, which now has 14 `noLink` cases.\n\nAuto-merge (squash) is enabled, so the PR merges as soon as CI is green.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
